abstract: >-
  Companion MATLAB/Python code for speech enhancement with a spherical
  microphone array of variable virtual-microphone density in noisy
  reverberant rooms, including baselines, ablations, metrics, and example audio.
keywords:
  - spherical microphone array
  - speech enhancement
  - beamforming
  - WPE
  - reverberation
  - human-machine interaction
